            <div xml:id="d27">

                <pb facs="0026" n="20" sameAs="frus:frus1942v03/pg20"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">859A.00/108: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the
                        Chargé in Iceland</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Warner</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1942-09-16T20:00:00-04:00">September 16,
                            1942—8 p.m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>304. Your 470, September 9. We have no objection to publication by the Prime
                    Minister of his memorandum of August 8 and the Legation’s note of August 20.
                    However, we do not now contemplate publishing this correspondence here.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Hull</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
